  "1038": "This sheet",
  "1039": "Source coverage, chapter by chapter",
  "1040": "The 2026 course description says the readings for the theory lectures are “primarily the first 11 chapters”. For Lecture 6 (\u003cem>Enforcement and Coercion\u003c/em>) it lists chapters 10–11 and adds: “You may also want to read Chapters 12 and 13, but please don't feel that you need to master these two chapters in detail.” \u003cspan class=\"tg e\">Slides 2026\u003c/span>",
