  "1045": "\u003cstrong>11 · Relationships\u003c/strong>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"pg\">pp. 100–108\u003c/span>",
  "1046": "Core (Lecture 6)",
  "1047": "2026 Lecture 6 \u003cem>Relationships\u003c/em> (reading: ch. 11); 2026 Lecture 4 (bridge from ch. 8); 2026 Lecture 8 (WTO); the examiner's mock feedback in the “Last Words” deck; 2021 Lecture 8; examiner's annotation on the 2025 tariff answer.",
