  "1551": "\u003cstrong>14 · Contracts and Governance\u003c/strong> (pp. 129–145)",
  "1552": "\u003cspan class=\"pill no\">⚠️ INCOMPLETE SOURCE COVERAGE\u003c/span>",
  "1553": "Title only. The 2021 slides (Contract Theory I–III: constrained sanctions, verifiability, allocating decision rights, principal–agent and measurement noise) are probably related.",
  "1554": "Photos of pp. 129–145",
  "1555": "\u003cstrong>15 · Limited Liability and Corporate Finance\u003c/strong> (pp. 146–153)",
  "1556": "\u003cspan class=\"pill no\">⚠️ INCOMPLETE SOURCE COVERAGE\u003c/span>",
