  "1558": "Photos of pp. 146–153",
  "1559": "\u003cstrong>16 · Asymmetric Information\u003c/strong> (pp. 154–160)",
  "1560": "\u003cspan class=\"pill no\">⚠️ INCOMPLETE SOURCE COVERAGE\u003c/span>",
